            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", ""]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/products/ — adds a new ingredient to the catalog. Requires auth.\nThe returned product `id` is auto-saved to the `productId` collection variable so you can immediately add it to your pantry or a recipe."
